================================================================================
Copyleft and GPL-licensed components in images
================================================================================

Some UMKIM-built container images bundle or install copyleft software:

  - wireguard-tools (GPL-2.0) — included in fleet-ansible-runner and node
    bootstrap images for WireGuard overlay configuration
  - lldap (GPL-3.0) — optional LDAP server in the fleet-console / fleet-ingress-auth
    Helm charts when console LDAP is enabled

Corresponding source code is available from the upstream projects listed above.
UMKIM does not modify wireguard-tools or lldap source; images install distribution
packages or upstream release artifacts at build time.

