================================================================================
Distribution compliance
================================================================================

UMKIM v0.2 is distributed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

To obtain source code for GPL-licensed binaries bundled in UMKIM images:

  1. Clone this repository: https://github.com/rborso/umkim
     (current image tag is `umkim_version` / `harbor_fleet_image_tag`, e.g.
     `0.2.0-dev`). Sibling DCM service-provider repositories are not required
     for the v0.2 hub image set.
  2. Follow build instructions in images/README.md and each component's
     Containerfile to reproduce the image layers that include copyleft software.
  3. For upstream components (wireguard-tools, lldap), obtain source from the
     upstream project URLs cited in VERSIONS.md.

For written source offers or compliance questions, open an issue or pull request in [UMKIM](https://github.com/rborso/umkim).

UBI-based images: redistribution of UBI layers must comply with Red Hat's
container terms (link above). UMKIM source repositories do not include Red Hat
proprietary packages beyond what is installed from public UBI repositories at
image build time.
